---
import Icon from './icons/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="customers" class="py-24 border-t border-subtle-stroke relative overflow-hidden bg-background">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border border-amber-500/20 font-mono">
        <Icon name="star" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>Enterprise Customer Impact</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">
        Proven ROI for global revenue leaders.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-secondary-fg leading-relaxed">
        See how high-growth scaleups and enterprise sales teams accelerated pipeline and slashed response times with New-Relay.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Featured Testimonial Case Study Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Case Study 1: Modal -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl enterprise-card space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-brand-500/40 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Metric Highlight Pill -->
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono border border-emerald-500/20">
            <span>+142% Inbound Conversion</span>
          </div>

          <p class="font-serif italic text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground leading-relaxed">
            “New-Relay completely transformed how our sales org responds to high-intent leads. Our speed to lead dropped from 45 minutes to 12 seconds with Captain AI, and our WhatsApp revenue velocity doubled in 60 days.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 pt-4 border-t border-subtle-stroke">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-brand-500/30">
            MS
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Margaret Shen</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-mono">Verified ✓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-secondary-fg">Head of Revenue Ops • Modal</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 2: Granola Health -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl enterprise-card space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Metric Highlight Pill -->
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono border border-purple-500/20">
            <span>-68% Support Resolution Time</span>
          </div>

          <p class="font-serif italic text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground leading-relaxed">
            “Having WhatsApp, SMS, and Email in one single collaborative dashboard eliminated our team's communication silos. The video testimonial collector alone helped us gather 80+ client reviews on autopilot.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 pt-4 border-t border-subtle-stroke">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-purple-500/30">
            TL
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Tyler Larson</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-mono">Verified ✓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-secondary-fg">Founder & CEO • Granola Health</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 3: Railway -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl enterprise-card space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <!-- Metric Highlight Pill -->
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono border border-emerald-500/20">
            <span>$1.2M+ Annual SaaS Savings</span>
          </div>

          <p class="font-serif italic text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground leading-relaxed">
            “The visual pipeline and AI Copilot give our reps exact talking points during live enterprise calls. It feels like having an expert sales engineer sitting right next to you for every prospect conversation.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 pt-4 border-t border-subtle-stroke">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm border border-emerald-500/30">
            ER
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Elena Rostova</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[11px] font-mono">Verified ✓</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-secondary-fg">VP Customer Success • Railway</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
